    "title": "DebugMcp",
    "version": "0.19.0",
    "description": "MCP server that gives AI agents full debugging capabilities for .NET applications. Supports 34 tools for breakpoints, stepping, inspection, memory analysis, module exploration, code analysis (Roslyn), exception autopsy, and process I/O — all via the Model Context Protocol. Built on ICorDebug for native, zero-overhead .NET debugging on Windows, macOS, and Linux."
